OL,9,G0915 Police Interceptors
OL,10,     FThere's a hunt for a dodgy Fiesta.
OL,11,     FBut with the interceptors on its
OL,12,     Ftail, the driver stacks the
OL,13,     Fvehicle into a roundabout and the
OL,14,     Foccupants go to ground.
OL,15,G1015 Police Interceptors
OL,16,     FPolice chase a stolen Renault
OL,17,     Funtil the driver crashes; a strip
OL,18,     Fsearch reveals Class A drugs;
OL,19,     Fpolice bust a large-scale cannabis
OL,20,     Ffarm; a man forgets to pay his gas
OL,21,     Fbill.
